---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="System Building — Zeus DeLaCruz" description="Full-stack sovereign system builds — from NATS fabric to AI agents to hardware.">
<!-- System Building v2 | /services/system-building/ -->
<section class="hero-full" style="min-height:auto;padding:3rem 0 2rem;">
  <div class="hero-badge">DONE-FOR-YOU</div>
  <h1 style="font-size:2.8rem;">Your <span style="color:var(--accent-bright);">sovereign operations center</span> — designed, built, and installed.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub" style="font-size:1.1rem;max-width:600px;">I spec the hardware, build the stack, ship it to you, and train your team. You plug it in and it runs. Full handoff in 30 days.</p>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">What You Get</h2>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1rem;">
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.25rem;">
      <h4>🖥️ Sovereign Node Hardware</h4>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Spec'd to your load. Mini PC or 1U server. Pre-installed with the full OneMind stack. Docker. Tailscale. NATS. TAK Server. ClickHouse. Agents. Ready to boot.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.25rem;">
      <h4>📡 Full Stack Deployment</h4>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">NATS cluster (or single-node). JetStream streams. TAK Server with certs. CloudTAK gateway. ClickHouse database. MediaMTX for cameras. Frigate NVR. Grafana dashboards. All wired together.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.25rem;">
      <h4>🧠 Agent Configuration</h4>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Legacy deployed. 4 pillar agents configured. Custom skills for your domain. NATS routing map. Agents wake up knowing your sensors, your cameras, your team.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.25rem;">
      <h4>📚 Custom Runbook</h4>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Your stack's DNA documented: architecture diagram, NATS subject map, port assignments, backup strategy, restore procedure, troubleshooting guide. Every command you'll ever need.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.25rem;">
      <h4>🎓 Training Session</h4>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">2-hour live session with your team. How to task the agents. How to read the dashboards. How to add sensors. How to recover from failure. Recorded for replay.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.25rem;">
      <h4>🛡️ 30-Day Handoff</h4>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">30 days of support after install. Daily health checks from the agents. Weekly sync calls. By day 30, you're running it yourself.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1rem;">Pricing</h2>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1rem;">
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.5rem;">
      <h4>Base System</h4>
      <p style="font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--accent-bright);margin:0.5rem 0;">$7,500</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Single-node Sovereign Node. Core stack (NATS, TAK, agents, ClickHouse). Up to 5 cameras. 1-3 users. Best for: homesteads, small teams, personal ops centers.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--black-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.5rem;">
      <h4>Full Deployment</h4>
      <p style="font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--accent-bright);margin:0.5rem 0;">$12,500 – $15,000</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Multi-node cluster. Redundant NATS. Load-balanced TAK. Enterprise ClickHouse. 10+ cameras. Custom plugin development. Team training. Best for: organizations, security teams, community networks.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:1.5rem;"><strong>Hardware cost separate</strong> — I spec it, you buy it (or I procure and bill at cost). Typical hardware: $500-$2,000. <strong>14-day refund on service.</strong> After 3 case studies, pricing moves to premium tier.</p>
</section>

<div style="text-align:center;padding:2rem 0;">
  <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-block;font-size:1rem;">Book a Discovery Call →</a>
  <p style="margin-top:0.75rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:#9ca3af;">⚠️ Zoho inquiry form — project scope questionnaire</p>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
